---
const whatsappUrl = "https://wa.me/595985123456?text=Hola!%20Quiero%20iniciar%20mi%20prueba%20gratuita%20de%2030%20días%20de%20Rentflow.";
---

<section class="py-20 md:py-32 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative">
    
    <!-- Background Gradient Card -->
    <div class="relative rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-14 lg:p-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-900/40 via-slate-900 to-indigo-950/40 border border-blue-500/30 text-center shadow-2xl shadow-blue-950/60 overflow-hidden">
      
      <!-- Decorative Glow -->
      <div class="absolute -top-24 -left-24 w-72 h-72 bg-blue-600/20 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-24 -right-24 w-72 h-72 bg-indigo-600/20 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>

      <div class="relative z-10 space-y-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <span class="inline-block text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-blue-400 bg-blue-500/10 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-blue-500/20">
          Transformá tu Gestión Inmobiliaria
        </span>
        
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black font-display uppercase tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
          Empezá tus 30 días de prueba <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-indigo-300 bg-clip-text text-transparent">gratis hoy</span>
        </h2>
        
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Unite a los propietarios y administradores en Paraguay que ya eliminaron las planillas de cálculo y gestionan con tranquilidad.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
          <a 
            href={whatsappUrl}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-black text-sm uppercase tracking-wider px-9 py-4 rounded-2xl shadow-xl shadow-blue-600/30 transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 border-t border-white/20 text-center"
          >
            Activar Prueba Gratuita por WhatsApp
          </a>
          <a 
            href="#precios"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 hover:text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.08] transition-all text-center"
          >
            Revisar Planes
          </a>
        </div>

        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 pt-2 font-medium">
          Sin tarjeta de crédito requerida • Configuración inmediata • Soporte en Asunción
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
